 {
  "name": "POST /api/DealV2/ListPublisherProducts - 按publisherProductId精确查询单个产品",
  "description": "单接口测试：POST /api/DealV2/ListPublisherProducts。sourceId=01ProposalSourceAmazonMedia，按publisherProductIdFilter精确查询已知productId的产品详情(用户在已知具体产品时直接定位)。500条随机样本中占比约34.0%（127次，373条中）。【注：ES原始样本publisherProductId(5EY7QZSWJC1X4YH6XDPF)经实测已从当前产品目录下架/找不到(CL/US/GB/DE/JP/MX/CA/FR均未命中)，属历史数据过期，非本接口bug；已改用config新增变量dealv2_publisher_product_id_for_search=CL目的地下当前真实可查的publisherProductId(6KH4SZR6AMS3，来自ListPublisherProducts浏览接口真实返回)；原dealv2_publisher_product_id变量保留不动，因GetPublisherProductRate接口仍需要用它才能查到有效报价(该产品虽已从ListPublisherProducts的浏览结果里下架，但报价服务里仍注册着)。】",
  "module": "DealV2",
  "granularity": "API",
  "since": "init",
  "last_modified": "init",
  "change_type": "NEW",
  "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
  "steps": [
   {
    "name": "调用 ListPublisherProducts(精确查询)",
    "method": "POST",
    "base_url": "{{DSPBASEURL}}",
    "path": "DealV2/ListPublisherProducts",
    "request_body": {
     "sourceId": "01ProposalSourceAmazonMedia",
     "profileId": "{{profile_id_single}}",
     "advertiserId": "{{advertiser_id_single}}",
     "countryFilter": {
      "include": [
       "CL"
      ]
     },
     "publisherProductIdFilter": {
      "include": [
       "{{dealv2_publisher_product_id_for_search}}"
      ]
     },
     "maxResults": 25,
     "sortField": "NAME",
     "sortOrder": "ASCENDING",
     "dealTypeFilter": {
      "include": [
       "PREFERRED_DEAL",
       "PROGRAMMATIC_GUARANTEED"
      ]
     }
    },
    "extract_vars": {},
    "expected_response": {
     "IsSuccessStatusCode": true,
     "Data.publisherProducts": {
      "$not_empty": true
     }
    }
   }
  ]
 },
